# MainScreenTheme

- Every application **screen** MUST wrap content with `MainScreenTheme` (`lib/app/screens/main_screen_theme.dart`).
- Do **not** create a `Scaffold` directly inside any screen.
- `Scaffold` exists only inside `MainScreenTheme`.
- New screens: build body/content and pass it into `MainScreenTheme` (app bar, FAB, etc. via its existing API).

```dart
// ❌ BAD
class FooScreen extends StatelessWidget {
  Widget build(context) => Scaffold(body: ...);
}

// ✅ GOOD
class FooScreen extends StatelessWidget {
  Widget build(context) => MainScreenTheme(
    // use existing MainScreenTheme params
    child: ...,
  );
}
```
